// A map place: navigation by clicking the picture rather than a list.
//
// Each option names its `region` — a colour in the lookup image — instead of
// being drawn as a button. The two are otherwise the same thing: same effects,
// same conditions, same code applying them.
//
// The art here is a placeholder generated by `tools/mapgen`, which emits the
// picture and the lookup from one set of shapes so they cannot drift apart.
(
  background: "maps/valley.png",
  lookup: Some("maps/valley_lookup.png"),
  caption: Some("The valley, seen from the ridge"),
  options: [
    (label: "The cairn on the shoulder", effect: GoTo("cairn"), region: Some((220, 60, 60))),
    (label: "The ledge under the ridge", effect: GoTo("ledge"), region: Some((60, 140, 220))),
    (label: "Back up to the ridge",      effect: GoTo("ridge"), region: Some((240, 200, 80))),
  ],
)
